msgid "A personal Microsoft account can make “anyone with the link” links but not “people in my organization” links. A work or school account can make both, unless its administrator forbids public links; then CaptureMann makes the organization link instead and says so. If sign-in later says the redirect does not match, add http://127.0.0.1/callback as a second redirect URI."
